dialogs
0	The TRAINERS who have gathered all the GYM BADGES of HOENN should make way to the ultimate destination.The POKéMON LEAGUE.Travel to the easternmost reaches of HOENN, to the island EVER GRANDE.There, you shall find the POKéMON LEAGUE.
1	Yo! How's it going, CHAMPION- bound PLAYER?SOOTOPOLIS's GYM LEADER JUAN is a master of WATER-type POKéMON.And, to get to JUAN, an icy floor will hamper your progress…Listen, I'm sorry, but that's all the advice that I have for you.The rest of the way, you have to go for it yourself!
